Package: matrixImpute
Type: Package
Title: Column-Wise Median Imputation and Docker Workflow
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Silvia", "Zani", email = "Silvia.zani@edu.unito.it", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reads numeric CSV matrices, reports missing-value statistics,
    performs column-wise median imputation, writes completed matrices,
    and provides a host-side Docker launcher for reproducible execution.
